# No Visual Companion Offers

Never offer, suggest, or ask about opening a local URL / web browser Visual Companion for mockups, diagrams, comparisons, or visuals.

Do not use phrases like:
- "Some of what we're working on might be easier to explain if I can show it to you in a web browser..."
- Any invitation to try a browser-based companion, mockup server, or local URL for brainstorming visuals

Use text-only explanations (and inline diagrams / mermaid when useful). If the brainstorming skill mentions Visual Companion, skip that step entirely for this user/project.
